<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina issued debt for $13.24 bln in 1996.</title>
<headline>Argentina issued debt for $13.24 bln in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine government said Monday it has issued debt for $13.24 billion in the world markets in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Adam, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 54 1 318-0654</p>
</text>
